及cleanup通过。HTTP注入合成回答，不是真实模型或业务验收。\n\n[精确提交CI39155201166](https://github.com/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/actions/runs/39155201166) 正在运行。4c3旧CI通过之后的新发现仍按独立问题处理；原fa77夹具竞态失败、所有红基线和取消记录均保留。独立锁定脚本末尾空行的差异检查提示单列，为保留锁定字节未修饰该文件。\n\n公开材料、非专家暂定标签、首次回答与冻结复评由依赖本PR的 #46 交付，已发布v26保留，本轮另建v27。没有新模型调用、训练、自动合并或生产部署。技术验证不等于人工业务验收，Issue #42 保持打开。\n","created_at":"2026-10-18T03:42:42Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T18:43:14Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"9645b76680ba8c47c8e754da526ced8e4e68ef00","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pulls/45/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pulls/45/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/issues/45/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/statuses/b0a9554d0b7ab1a064ce490cee181d2197c31b0c","head":{"label":"ZZZZihan:feature/material-facts-v7-guards","ref":"feature/material-facts-v7-guards","sha":"b0a9554d0b7ab1a064ce490cee181d2197c31b0c","user":{"login":"ZZZZihan","id":113167863,"node_id":"U_kgDOBr7N9w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113167863?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan","html_url":"https://github.com/ZZZZihan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/repos","events_url":"ht